# Static-host headers (Netlify / Cloudflare Pages syntax).
#
# The dashboards and the hosted form must never be framable — that is what makes
# a clickjacked Approve button impossible. The embed route is the deliberate
# exception: sellers put /embed/<slug> in an iframe on their own website.
#
# Nginx and other hosts need the same policy expressed their own way; see
# SECURITY.md section 5.2.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/embed/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors https:
  X-Frame-Options:
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
